<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{A74250BF-490F-D2A8-34FB-506B76E90D24}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Slide Number Placeholder 1"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{4C847063-DE85-415C-FBDF-3ABA5548A9CA}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="sldNum" sz="quarter" idx="12"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:fld id="{A49DFD55-3C28-40EF-9E31-A92D2E4017FF}" type="slidenum"><a:rPr lang="en-US" smtClean="0"/><a:pPr/><a:t>42</a:t></a:fld><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Title 2"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{CB45D75B-65A8-2192-DEC4-A2340E4EC450}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph type="title"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>design</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Content Placeholder 3"><a:extLst><a:ext uri="{FF2B5EF4-FFF2-40B4-BE49-F238E27FC236}"><a16:creationId xmlns:a16="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/drawing/2014/main" id="{1BE1A853-CE6B-6482-C824-716256BFE7D2}"/></a:ext></a:extLst></p:cNvPr><p:cNvSpPr><a:spLocks noGrp="1"/></p:cNvSpPr><p:nvPr><p:ph idx="1"/></p:nvPr></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr/><p:txBody><a:bodyPr/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>This representation allows us to design volumetric weaves with different local configurations</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>It is possible to determine all the local configurations manually</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>However, this process becomes infeasible when the domain size to large</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="742950" lvl="1" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Even for a simple design of 3x3x3 </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>cP</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>-Weave, there are at least 1,865,626,264,837,390,598,144 distinct set of </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0" err="1"/><a:t>cP</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>-Weaves</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="285750" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Therefore we need a design strategy that either:</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="742950" lvl="1" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Projects the design space to a smaller design space</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="742950" lvl="1" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/><a:t>Supports algebraic operations to transform from one design to another design</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="742950" lvl="1" indent="-285750"><a:buFont typeface="Arial" panose="020B0604020202020204" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:buChar char="•"/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="137704433"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>